flowchart TD
    START["🌞 TINZA — carry into NEW chat. Costing 91% real. STAGED (not pushed): 5 files E3 Cultural excision + A2 buffet cull (node --check PASS x5). 🔥 NEW MAJOR WORKSTREAM THIS SESSION = RECIPE DEPTH + WOW + DISH FAMILIES (the paid-for differentiator). Two locked docs: TINZA_RECIPE_DEPTH_STANDARD.md + TINZA_DISH_FAMILIES.md. Model: Claude DRAFTS, Tina REVIEWS, push. Batch-1 heroes drafted (spag bol·bangers·fish·lasagne·cape malay curry) + mealiepap wow — AWAITING TINA REVIEW. NEXT = build variations+family renderer strips, then Fried Dough + Maize Porridge families."]

