        PUB["A2 buffet dead-cull (5th file) — buffet.js: removed orphaned category path left by the EARLIER buffet→planView migration: getCategory() + 7 *_KEYS arrays + normName() + extractScaled() (38 dead lines). Live parser (practicalIngredient/improveIngredientName/computeQuantity/parseAmt/cleanIngredientName/courseDishes) untouched. buffetStep7 still returns planView. node --check PASS."]
        PU2["⚠️ Still pending (from earlier): kiddies 'crisps' → file 'Crisps.jpg' case 404 on live. Rename to crisps.jpg OR add photoName:'Crisps'."]
    end

    subgraph NEXT["🎯 NEXT CODE TASK — Events sameness done; pick one after push"]
